WEBVTT

00:00:25.498 --> 00:00:26.833
DRACO:
Well, well.

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:29.878
What brings you here, Potter?

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:32.547
I could ask you the same.

00:00:33.172 --> 00:00:35.216
You have something of mine.

00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:37.760
I'd like it back.

00:00:37.802 --> 00:00:40.305
-What's wrong with the one you have?
DRACO: It's my mother's.

00:00:40.346 --> 00:00:44.350
It's powerful, but it's not the same.

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:48.021
Doesn't quite understand me.

00:00:48.521 --> 00:00:49.981
Know what I mean?

00:00:50.565 --> 00:00:52.525
Why didn't you tell her?

00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:55.403
Bellatrix.

00:00:58.781 --> 00:01:02.035
You knew it was me.
You didn't say anything.

00:01:04.078 --> 00:01:08.374
Come on, Draco.
Don't be a prat. Do him.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.501
DRACO:
Easy.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.338
Expelliarmus.

00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:14.547
Avada Kedavra!

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:15.590
Stupefy!

00:01:18.718 --> 00:01:20.053
[YELLS]

00:01:20.094 --> 00:01:23.097
RON:
That's my girlfriend, you numpties!

00:01:24.766 --> 00:01:26.935
[HARRY PANTING AND COUGHING]

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:32.982
[CHATTERING]

00:01:33.024 --> 00:01:34.776
[SCREECHING]

00:01:44.702 --> 00:01:46.329
HARRY:
Got it.

00:01:53.127 --> 00:01:54.462
RON:
Run!

00:01:55.713 --> 00:01:56.923
Run!

00:01:57.256 --> 00:01:58.967
[RON SCREAMING]

00:02:00.969 --> 00:02:03.805
Goyle's setting the bloody place on fire!

00:02:25.451 --> 00:02:26.911
[ROARS]

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:06.617
[SCREAMS]

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.707
Come on! This way!

00:03:20.048 --> 00:03:22.175
We can't leave them.

00:03:22.216 --> 00:03:24.385
He's joking, right?

00:03:33.061 --> 00:03:35.897
If we die for them, Harry,
I'm gonna kill you.

00:03:51.662 --> 00:03:53.081
[GRUNTING]

00:03:58.586 --> 00:04:00.254
HERMIONE:
Harry!

00:04:15.561 --> 00:04:17.438
[HISSES]

00:04:18.981 --> 00:04:21.609
[PANTING AND GROANING]

00:04:46.676 --> 00:04:48.094
My Lord?

00:04:48.136 --> 00:04:50.680
Avada Kedavra!

00:04:57.019 --> 00:05:01.315
Come, Nagini. I need to keep you safe.

00:05:02.608 --> 00:05:04.569
[PANTING]

00:05:13.661 --> 00:05:15.621
HARRY:
It's the snake.

00:05:15.663 --> 00:05:19.292
She's the last one. It's the last Horcrux.

00:05:25.965 --> 00:05:28.467
RON:
Look inside him, Harry.

00:05:28.509 --> 00:05:32.430
Find out where he is.
If we find him, we can find the snake.

00:05:32.471 --> 00:05:34.599
Then we can end this.

